    observer["Visibility evidence store / identity / responses / polls / Bound t2 -&gt; observed t3"]
    recovery["Recovery snapshots / journal / pending / manifest / Prefix + canonical bindings"]
    report["Derived measurement report / All-attempt denominator / Null missing timestamps"]
